From d4b249a39a0fb9ab7181189483db0259e768d5da Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mili Contributors <mili-contributors@example.invalid>
Date: Sat, 28 Nov 2026 11:18:29 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Gate new Nether portals before async detachment

Port from Lophine 7a51f49, Minecraft patch 0132. See META-INF/licenses/carpet-26.3.txt.

Restricted entities resolve an existing exit before detaching, checking again on the source owner before starting the transfer. No match never dispatches the native no-frame destination fallback. The synchronous path still honors PortalEventResult.canCreatePortal.

